# Publish machinery — assembled by prepack, removed by postpack.
#
# Both are build artifacts of `npm pack`, not source: vendor-children.mjs copies
# the sibling children into _children/ and the sibling rapper_director/ into
# _director/, and clean-children.mjs deletes both again. They exist for the
# seconds in between.
#
# THEY MUST BOTH BE IGNORED. This repo is PUBLIC. If a pack is interrupted or
# fails between prepack and postpack, whatever is left behind sits untracked
# here, and gitEr/shipAll.sh commits with `git add -A`. _director/ carries the
# publish and deploy scripts, which were moved out of rapper on 26 Aug 2026
# precisely so a contributor cloning this repo never sees them — leaking them
# back through a failed pack would undo that move.
#
# _children/ was ignored from the start; _director/ was added to the vendor step
# later and did not get its guard until 27 Aug 2026.
_children/
_director/

# 49 MB of basemap tiles + pin art, copied in by getCache_OfflineMap/fetchAssets.sh.
# NEVER commit: 3587 binary files, and ReTreever/static is their source of truth.
static/mobileAssets/

# Written by the installer into a scaffold only; absent here = serve every child.
mounted.json
